{"type":"json_object","message":"The reserve for product warranties is disclosed as $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006 and $4 million at Dec. 31, 2005. The change from 2005 to 2006 is the 2006 balance minus the 2005 balance, in USD millions. I am using q11n3 for the 2006 reserve and q11n4 for the 2005 reserve.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"reserve_2006 - reserve_2005","variables":{"reserve_2006":{"value":10,"source":"source:q11n3","unit":"USD_million"},"reserve_2005":{"value":4,"source":"source:q11n4","unit":"USD_million"}},"sources":{"reserve_2006":"source:q11n3","reserve_2005":"source:q11n4"}}}